#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Filename              :       postInwardClgCheque_validateChqDetails.scr
# Description           :       This script validates the Cheque details.
# Input                 :       Customer ID
# Output                :       Success or Failure
# Calling Script        :       postInwardClgCheque_main.scr
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
